  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meals with Dignity for Unsheltered in Houston</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community LUV is a meal and resource program for people experiencing homelessness and food insecurity. It will provide breakfast snacks and hot nutritious lunch in a &quot;sit down- dine in&quot; experience for 50-65 people each month. Prior to lunch, we will provide participants with free access to hot showers, clean underwear, a selection of clothing, sanitizer, PPE, and access to free barber/beauty services. Additionally, social services providers will be available to address sustainability needs.</narrative>
  </description>
